{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open World Multiplayer VR Pirate Game</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684010/extras/5a0d34dcfb1519441df4515659a2fd23.poster.avif?t=1771007658\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684010/extras/5a0d34dcfb1519441df4515659a2fd23.webm?t=1771007658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684010/extras/5a0d34dcfb1519441df4515659a2fd23.mp4?t=1771007658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Multiplayer has come to Sail VR!!! </strong><br><br>Rally your crew and set Sail in the NEW Sail VR Multiplayer experience!!!<br><br><i>BUT BE WARNED . . .</i><br><br>You're not the only Pirate seeking fortune on the seas.<br><br>Fight off Pirate enemies on land with your Pirate weapon of choice<br><br>- OR -<br><br>Battle them on the seas using your ship's cannons and crew<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684010/extras/603dab2cdfa32295c9ec0befe9838b8f.poster.avif?t=1771007658\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684010/extras/603dab2cdfa32295c9ec0befe9838b8f.webm?t=1771007658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684010/extras/603dab2cdfa32295c9ec0befe9838b8f.mp4?t=1771007658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sail Multiplayer is loaded with repayable features including: </h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>- Social Lobbies: Join forces with friends or make new ones in the pirate social lobbies. <br></li><li>- Player Customization: Customize your pirate look with hats, eye patches, jackets, beards &amp; more!!! <br></li><li>- PvP Pirate Combat: Battle other crews in in exhilarating ship-to-ship combat or sword duels.<br></li><li>- PvE Combat: Face off against cunning NPCs on land and sea. <br></li><li>- XP &amp; Leveling: Level up as you plunder and earn your pirate reputation<br></li><li>- Treasure Hunting: Solve riddles and puzzles to be lead to buried loot. <br></li><li>- Extraction Game Mode:  Outwit and outplay other crews for treasure and glory but you only get to keep it if you make it out alive.</li></ul><br>With an Open World filled with Treasure, Mysterious Islands and limitless possibilities there's only one question left to ask...<br><br><strong>Arrrrgh you ready to set SAIL ???</strong><br><br><i>PLEASE NOTE: SAIL is in Early Access / Beta and may contain bugs. We appreciate any and all feedback. Download SAIL and join us and our awesome community as we work to create the best VR pirate game possible! </i><br><br>THANK YOU FOR SUPPORTING SAIL!!!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Pirate King","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1684010/abefbe38003f9cbea1d3b478a24249e5ac13d8f2.jpg"},{"name":"What the Duck?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1684010/ffd60924039a6a51f96f2f7319779b7000943a6e.jpg"},{"name":"Beta Tester","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1684010/e941afd1377a2cf867e43e86740293b947837cff.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1684010?t=1771007658","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684010/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771007658","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684010/dcd901d2f34aa917958ba3e3789161c3683ac491/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771007658","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684